                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "5/5 There isn't a repetitive grind aspect about the campaign with the random seeds for hive jumps. I cleared it alone, only dislike I have is starting the second campaign + the difficulty increases? The achievement page states only 4.5% of players have cleared the final boss for the first campaign and 5.5% of the players cleared the first campaign. There are 3 more campaigns with the difficulty increasing.... I think a 3rd Hive Jump would be great for us but the multiplayer side is lacking heavily. .....do i start the second campaign when 96% of the people did not clear the first... with or without help.......?? ?!?!? ?!?? 4.6 hours to clear the 1st",
